      "q": "How much does AmerisourceBergen Drug make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "AmerisourceBergen Drug received $5.1B in federal contract obligations in FY2026 to date. AmerisourceBergen Drug won 328,437 awards this fiscal year so far, with an average award size of $15.6K, and obligations fell 31.2% year over year."
    },
    {
      "q": "Which agencies buy from AmerisourceBergen Drug?",
