      "q": "What does AmerisourceBergen Drug sell to the government?",
      "a": "AmerisourceBergen Drug sells products in Medicinal and Botanical Manufacturing and related pharmaceutical distribution markets. Medicinal and Botanical Manufacturing accounted for $3.5B, Drugs and Druggists' Sundries Merchant Wholesalers accounted for $1.7B, and Pharmaceutical Preparation Manufacturing accounted for $639K in FY2026 to date."
